  "why": "A post-tensioned slab carries a specialist prestressing trade (tendon layout, profiling, stressing and grouting) in addition to reduced passive rebar, thinner section and normal formwork/concrete; the PT operation must be its own component because its crew, plant (jacks) and materials (strand/anchorages) are entirely different from ordinary steel fixing.",
