    "Slab ~200–240 mm (≈0.22 m3/m2), thinner than RC equivalent",
    "Single 8 hr/day shift",
    "Specialist PT subcontractor crew",
    "Bonded system with ducts + grout (or unbonded mono-strand)",
    "Stressing at ~75% GUTS after strength gain"
  ],
